  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29315001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "莉莉奈，为什么我在早餐里吃到了小章鱼？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29315002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "不清楚。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29315003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "也许是我那个笨蛋哥哥干的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29315004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你能不能不要一边否认，一边若无其事地清理杀戮者二号上的墨汁啊？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29315005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "不喜欢吗？明明很好吃。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29315006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不是喜不喜欢的问题，没有人早上吃这个的吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29315007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "更何况，它的触角还是会动的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29315008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "这样吃才美味哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29315009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……所以，你是想把自己喜欢的东西分享给主人，才这么做的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29315010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不是恶作剧吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29315011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "嗯（点头）。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29315012",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "噗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29315013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……果然你是故意的吧？！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
